# When present, this file REPLACES .gitignore for EAS build archives.
# It exists so that EAS build flows can ship three gitignored local fallback
# files that the build needs but that we do not want in version control:
#
#   - .env.local                   (used by Metro/Expo to load SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN
#                                   so Sentry source maps upload during builds)
#   - google-services.json         (Firebase Android config required by prebuild)
#   - GoogleService-Info.plist     (Firebase iOS config required by prebuild)
#
# Background: the Firebase EAS file variables are intentionally scoped to the
# production environment with Sensitive visibility. Keeping the root files in
# the archive preserves local, development, and preview build fallback behavior.
#
# IMPORTANT: keep this file in sync with .gitignore. If you add a new exclusion
# to .gitignore, mirror it here too — otherwise the file will leak into EAS
# build archives.
# Never leave the reusable SENTRY_SETUP_AUTH_TOKEN in .env.local when creating a
# build. It is a local provisioning credential and must not be sent to EAS.

# dependencies
node_modules/

# Expo
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts

# Native
.kotlin/
*.orig.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision

# Metro
.metro-health-check*

# debug
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*

# macOS
.DS_Store
*.pem

# NOTE: .env.local intentionally NOT excluded here — see header comment.

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

app-example

# Native folders
/android/
/ios/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace

# Firebase
firebase-debug.log
# NOTE: /GoogleService-Info.plist and /google-services.json intentionally NOT
# excluded here — they need to ship to EAS builds. They remain gitignored.

# Claude
.claude/

#Codex
.codex/

# Misc
.superpowers/
tmp/

# Git worktrees
.worktrees/

# Fastlane
fastlane/.private/
fastlane/.tmp/
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/README.md
fastlane/ios/metadata/review_information/*
!fastlane/ios/metadata/review_information/notes.txt
fastlane/ios/review/*
!fastlane/ios/review/.gitkeep
.env.fastlane.local
